  "description": "High-performance io_uring transport for HttpClient / SocketsHttpHandler. Replaces default socket I/O with Linux io_uring for batched syscalls, zero-copy send, and buffer rings. Up to 69% faster throughput on Linux.",
  "id": "HttpClient.IoUring",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-03-20T12:00:32.993Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
